    "name": "Top Percent",
    "steam_appid": 2852860,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the exhilarating world of &quot;Top Percent&quot; where the thrill of battle royale meets the festive fun of party games in our unique &quot;Party Royale&quot; genre. This innovative blend offers an unmatched gaming experience, catering to a diverse audience - from the competitive zeal of battle royale enthusiasts to the lighthearted enjoyment of party game fans. Embark on a journey with Top Percent where strategic depth and entertainment collide, ensuring an unforgettable adventure for every player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/3e4c06a1d335041af547dc9d781baf71.poster.avif?t=1750061399\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/3e4c06a1d335041af547dc9d781baf71.webm?t=1750061399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/3e4c06a1d335041af547dc9d781baf71.mp4?t=1750061399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a focus on multiplayer action for 2-10 players per lobby, the game promotes both competitive and cooperative play. Choose from different game modes including 'Play with Friends,' 'Play Casual' and 'Play Ranked,' each offering a unique experience. The game is designed to be accessible to newcomers while providing deep strategic gameplay for veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/8b936a4224d19853fd1c6ee19fdb0f7b.poster.avif?t=1750061399\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/8b936a4224d19853fd1c6ee19fdb0f7b.webm?t=1750061399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/8b936a4224d19853fd1c6ee19fdb0f7b.mp4?t=1750061399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with a wide range of skins, masks and clothing options while engaging with the community through regularly updated themes, challenges and rewards. Top Percent is not just a game; it's a platform for competition and community with plans for Esports tournaments and a robust ranking system to engage the most skilled players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/cd168a093d6f7817f9f68de06d5e5414.poster.avif?t=1750061399\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/cd168a093d6f7817f9f68de06d5e5414.webm?t=1750061399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/cd168a093d6f7817f9f68de06d5e5414.mp4?t=1750061399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you plan to utilize your strategic foresight, closely watching the frontrunners until a vulnerable moment reveals itself, or will you unleash your full power from the outset, aiming to maintain dominance throughout?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/12c1cef7b3773aaa2451c09b7b3822e2.poster.avif?t=1750061399\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/12c1cef7b3773aaa2451c09b7b3822e2.webm?t=1750061399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/12c1cef7b3773aaa2451c09b7b3822e2.mp4?t=1750061399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the adventure in Top Percent and experience the thrill of the Party Royale genre where every match is an adventure and every player has a chance to shine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/79dd988b0a901a68da56283ffed0c1d2.poster.avif?t=1750061399\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/79dd988b0a901a68da56283ffed0c1d2.webm?t=1750061399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/79dd988b0a901a68da56283ffed0c1d2.mp4?t=1750061399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the exhilarating world of &quot;Top Percent&quot; where the thrill of battle royale meets the festive fun of party games in our unique &quot;Party Royale&quot; genre. This innovative blend offers an unmatched gaming experience, catering to a diverse audience - from the competitive zeal of battle royale enthusiasts to the lighthearted enjoyment of party game fans. Embark on a journey with Top Percent where strategic depth and entertainment collide, ensuring an unforgettable adventure for every player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/3e4c06a1d335041af547dc9d781baf71.poster.avif?t=1750061399\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/3e4c06a1d335041af547dc9d781baf71.webm?t=1750061399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/3e4c06a1d335041af547dc9d781baf71.mp4?t=1750061399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a focus on multiplayer action for 2-10 players per lobby, the game promotes both competitive and cooperative play. Choose from different game modes including 'Play with Friends,' 'Play Casual' and 'Play Ranked,' each offering a unique experience. The game is designed to be accessible to newcomers while providing deep strategic gameplay for veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/8b936a4224d19853fd1c6ee19fdb0f7b.poster.avif?t=1750061399\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"htt