?t=1750061399\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/12c1cef7b3773aaa2451c09b7b3822e2.webm?t=1750061399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/12c1cef7b3773aaa2451c09b7b3822e2.mp4?t=1750061399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the adventure in Top Percent and experience the thrill of the Party Royale genre where every match is an adventure and every player has a chance to shine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/79dd988b0a901a68da56283ffed0c1d2.poster.avif?t=1750061399\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/79dd988b0a901a68da56283ffed0c1d2.webm?t=1750061399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852860/extras/79dd988b0a901a68da56283ffed0c1d2.mp4?t=1750061399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p>",
    "short_description": "Top Percent is a &quot;Party Royale&quot; game that combines the excitement of battle royale with the joy of party games, offering players a thrilling and entertaining experience with diverse challenges and strategic gameplay. Join the fun, beat your foes and rise to the top in &quot;Top Percent&quot; today!",
